<LanguageData>
  
  <!-- EN: Demolisher Rocket Round -->
  <DMS_Bullet_DR.label>聚能穿甲火箭彈</DMS_Bullet_DR.label>
  
  <!-- EN: Disposable Launcher -->
  <DMS_DeposableRocketLauncher.label>拋棄式火箭筒</DMS_DeposableRocketLauncher.label>
  <!-- EN: A single use recoilless rifle designed to be fired and discarded. It's light-weight and effective against bunkers and heavy mechs. It has a long fire range and requires line of sight. -->
  <DMS_DeposableRocketLauncher.description>一種配重式無後座力火箭推進榴彈發射器，是殖民艦隊設計用於發配給游擊隊與機兵小隊使用的反裝甲武器，相比於可填裝型號其重量更輕，可有效對抗掩體或裝甲載具。</DMS_DeposableRocketLauncher.description>
  <!-- EN: charge -->
  <DMS_DeposableRocketLauncher.comps.CompApparelReloadable.chargeNoun>彈藥</DMS_DeposableRocketLauncher.comps.CompApparelReloadable.chargeNoun>
  <!-- EN: on cooldown -->
  <DMS_DeposableRocketLauncher.comps.CompApparelReloadable.cooldownGerund>冷卻中</DMS_DeposableRocketLauncher.comps.CompApparelReloadable.cooldownGerund>
  <!-- EN: Disposable Launcher -->
  <DMS_DeposableRocketLauncher.verbs.Verb_LaunchProjectile.label>拋棄式火箭筒</DMS_DeposableRocketLauncher.verbs.Verb_LaunchProjectile.label>
  
  <!-- UNUSED -->
  <DMS_DeposableRocketLauncher.verbs.Verb_Shoot.label>拋棄式火箭筒</DMS_DeposableRocketLauncher.verbs.Verb_Shoot.label>
  <DMS_DeposableRocketLauncher.verbs.Verb_LaunchProjectileStaticCE.label>拋棄式火箭筒</DMS_DeposableRocketLauncher.verbs.Verb_LaunchProjectileStaticCE.label>
  

  <!--==================== 4KG 一次性輕型無後座力砲 ====================-->
  
  <!-- EN: light recoilless rifle -->
  <DMS_Gun_RecoillessLight.label>輕型無後座力砲</DMS_Gun_RecoillessLight.label>
  <!-- EN: A four-kilogram disposable recoilless launcher, issued down to squad level as a throwaway answer to armor, bunkers and doorways. The fibre-wound tube is discarded once fired, and its fire control unit accepts four interchangeable warheads, so the operator picks the effect before the tube ever reaches the shoulder.\n\nIt is light enough for a scout drone to carry, and its shaped-charge warhead defeats plating far above its own weight class, while the demolition and screening rounds let a single trooper open a wall or cover a withdrawal. The cost is that everything is spent in one shot: no reload, a short effective range, and a backblast signature that tells every gun on the field where the operator is standing. -->
  <DMS_Gun_RecoillessLight.description>一具四公斤級的拋棄式無後座力發射器，配發至班級單位，用來處理裝甲、掩體與需要被打開的門。纖維纏繞發射管在擊發後即行丟棄，其火控單元可容納四種可互換彈頭，操作手在扛上肩之前就得決定要造成什麼效果。\n\n它輕到連偵察無人機都掛得動，聚能裝藥彈頭能擊穿遠超其噸位的裝甲，而爆破彈與煙霧彈讓單兵得以自行開牆或掩護撤離。代價是一切都在一發之內用盡：不能再裝填、有效射程偏短，而且尾焰特徵會告訴戰場上每一支槍管操作手站在哪裡。</DMS_Gun_RecoillessLight.description>
  <!-- EN: tube -->
  <DMS_Gun_RecoillessLight.tools.tube.label>發射管</DMS_Gun_RecoillessLight.tools.tube.label>
  <!-- EN: charge -->
  <DMS_Gun_RecoillessLight.comps.CompApparelReloadable.chargeNoun>彈藥</DMS_Gun_RecoillessLight.comps.CompApparelReloadable.chargeNoun>
  <!-- EN: on cooldown -->
  <DMS_Gun_RecoillessLight.comps.CompApparelReloadable.cooldownGerund>冷卻中</DMS_Gun_RecoillessLight.comps.CompApparelReloadable.cooldownGerund>
  
  <!-- EN: 65mm HE-frag rocket -->
  <DMS_Bullet_LRR_HE.label>高爆破片彈</DMS_Bullet_LRR_HE.label>
  <!-- EN: A thin-cased fragmentation warhead loaded with a light bursting charge. The wide fragment pattern strips infantry out of the open and clears trench lines, but the soft case flattens against plating instead of punching through it. -->
  <DMS_Bullet_LRR_HE.description>薄殼高爆破片彈頭，裝填輕量炸藥。寬廣的破片散佈能把開闊地上的步兵清乾淨，也適合清理戰壕線，但軟質彈殼撞上裝甲板只會被壓扁，穿不進去。</DMS_Bullet_LRR_HE.description>
  
  <!-- EN: 65mm shaped-charge rocket -->
  <DMS_Bullet_LRR_HEAT.label>聚能穿甲彈</DMS_Bullet_LRR_HEAT.label>
  <!-- EN: A copper-lined shaped charge that collapses into a hypervelocity jet on impact. The jet defeats armor no other warhead in this weight class can touch, but everything it carries goes into a single narrow channel, so anything standing beside the point of impact walks away. -->
  <DMS_Bullet_LRR_HEAT.description>銅襯聚能裝藥，撞擊時塌陷成超高速金屬射流。這道射流能貫穿同噸位彈頭碰都碰不到的裝甲，但威力全部集中在一條窄小的通道裡，站在命中點旁邊的人可以毫髮無傷地走開。</DMS_Bullet_LRR_HEAT.description>
  
  <!-- EN: 65mm demolition warhead -->
  <DMS_Bullet_LRR_Demolition.label>爆破彈</DMS_Bullet_LRR_Demolition.label>
  <!-- EN: A blunt-nosed warhead packed with a slow, heaving explosive filler. It is tuned to shear walls, doors and support structures rather than to injure, and does far more to a building than the same charge fired as a fragmentation round. -->
  <DMS_Bullet_LRR_Demolition.description>鈍頭彈頭，填裝低爆速的推擠型炸藥。它被調校用來剪斷牆體、門與承重結構而非殺傷人員，同樣的裝藥量對建築造成的破壞遠大於破片彈。</DMS_Bullet_LRR_Demolition.description>
  
  <!-- EN: 65mm airburst smoke round -->
  <DMS_Bullet_LRR_Smoke.label>空爆煙霧彈</DMS_Bullet_LRR_Smoke.label>
  <!-- EN: A screening round with a proximity fuze that bursts short of the ground, spreading its obscurant over a wider area than a ground-burst canister. It does no damage at all; it exists to break line of sight so a squad can cross open ground or drag its casualties back. -->
  <DMS_Bullet_LRR_Smoke.description>帶近炸引信的遮蔽彈，在觸地前於空中炸開，煙幕散佈範圍比觸發式煙罐更廣。它完全不造成傷害，存在的意義是切斷視線，讓班組得以通過開闊地或把傷員拖回來。</DMS_Bullet_LRR_Smoke.description>
  
</LanguageData>